        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you know what a Triple-A quality game is? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here at Zweihander Studio, we focus on making the lowest of the low quality game that we call Single-Z quality game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our very first game, Bombastar, is an explosive, grid-based puzzle game with a variety of modes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Standard Mode</strong> features the following 4 different game rules that you can enjoy</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Marathon: Reach a higher level when 3 rows of new blocks are spawned.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Line: Reach a higher level by keeping all of your remaining block under the red line.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain: Reach a higher level by increasing your Chain counter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Garbage: Reach a higher level by clearing annoying Garbage Blocks.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle Mode</strong> features 50 hand-crafted puzzles that you can play to test your skills. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also solve simple procedural generated Puzzle in this mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Conqueror Mode</strong> combine the other game mode into 1 big challenge with a simple objective, clear every block and reveal the picture underneath! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this mode, you can complete mission to unlock blocks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also spawn blocks that you have destroyed back into the grid to strategically clear blocks that you have not yet unlocked!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try out this affordable game today!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you know what a Triple-A quality game is? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here at Zweihander Studio, we focus on making the lowest of the low quality game that we call Single-Z quality game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our very first game, Bombastar, is an explosive, grid-based puzzle game with a variety of modes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Standard Mode</strong> features the following 4 different game rules that you can enjoy</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Marathon: Reach a higher level when 3 rows of new blocks are spawned.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Line: Reach a higher level by keeping all of your remaining block under the red line.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain: Reach a higher level by increasing your Chain counter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Garbage: Reach a higher level by clearing annoying Garbage Blocks.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle Mode</strong> features 50 hand-crafted puzzles that you can play to test your skills. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also solve simple procedural generated Puzzle in this mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Conqueror Mode</strong> combine the other game mode into 1 big challenge with a simple objective, clear every block and reveal the picture underneath! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this mode, you can complete mission to unlock blocks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also spawn blocks that you have destroyed back into the grid to strategically clear blocks that you have not yet unlocked!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try out this affordable game today!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "short_description": "Bombastar is an explosive grid-based puzzle game with a variety of game modes that you can enjoy. This game contains a variety of endless game modes and 50 handcrafted puzzles that you can play to your heart content. Build up combo and reach new height in this affordable Single-Z quality game!",
